Scope of this license

"Software" above means the source code of The Last Token: the GDScript under
`scripts/` and `tools/`, the scene and resource files under `scenes/` and
`themes/`, the data files under `data/`, the PowerShell runners, the project
configuration, and the documentation under `docs/`.

Art and audio assets are NOT covered by this license and are excluded from the
grant above. That includes everything under `assets/` — map and character art,
portraits, minigame art, the Staff Room reveal panels, icons, music, and sound
effects — much of which is placeholder or generated material kept only so the
project runs. Do not assume any reuse right in those files.

Fonts under `assets/fonts/` carry their own upstream licenses; see
`docs/FONT_CREDITS.md`.

Godot Engine is licensed separately by its authors and is not distributed here.
